Here are the main classes.

```mermaid
classDiagram
  class SyncEngine {
    +OpenFolderAsync()
    +SaveFileAsync(path, content)
  }
  class ChatEngine {
    +SendAsync(text)
  }
  class IFolderAccess {
    <<interface>>
    +WriteAsync(path, bytes)
  }
  SyncEngine --> IFolderAccess : writes
  ChatEngine ..> SyncEngine : asks
```

That is all.
